lat so\nwe can cut cookie shapes.","start":85841,"dur":4299},{"text":"I want to make star cookies.\nCan I use the big ones, too?","start":90420,"dur":4400},{"text":"Look at my star. It's perfect.\nDid you see, Jack?","start":94821,"dur":5039},{"text":"Now we wait for them to bake.\nThey will be ready soon.","start":99861,"dur":4559},{"text":"Almost got it.\nThis faucet has been leaking for days.","start":105080,"dur":4160},{"text":"Yes, they are wonderful helpers.\nAnna learned new weather words today.","start":109640,"dur":5680},{"text":"That's wonderful.\nLearning new words makes me so happy.","start":115670,"dur":4450}],"analysisVersion":1,"punctuatedByAi":false,"createdAt":0,"updatedAt":0,"sample":{"level":"A1","topic":"雨の日のお手伝い（Level 1 の物語）","reason":"現在形の短い文が続く物語。語彙は日常の基本語（約 126 語/分）","wpm":126,"license":"CC BY（クリエイティブ・コモンズ表示）","credit":"Easy With Ella（YouTube）・訳と区切りは AI が作成","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yA19NlvQrO0"}}